    <briefdescription>
<para>Regression tests for Wave 1 CRITICAL gap fixes in the server module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Covers:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>W1-FIX(thread_join_no_timeout) – timed join via std::async</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>W1-FIX(data_race/call_once) – std::call_once for static init</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>W1-FIX(data_race/api_handlers) – monitoring_api_ snapshot under mutex</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>W1-FIX(no_timeout/mqtt_write) – send-timeout on synchronous writes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>W1-FIX(missing_audit_log/shard) – authorize decision logged</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>W1-FIX(missing_audit_log/rope) – authorize decision logged</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.0.1 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Wave: 1 (CRITICAL gap remediation, 2026-08-25) </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
